==Healing potions==
Potions do not incur the standard 3 tick (1.8 second) attack or eat delay. This can make them the best source of healing for some types of PvP; or a powerful tool for PvM situations where damage is a higher priority than inventory space, such as competing for bossing drops, or speed related combat achievements.

For example, a player releasing [[snowy knight (item)|snowy knights]] instead of eating normal foods would be able to heal for 15 hitpoints every 1.8 seconds without losing any attacks. This can be a substantial amount of damage and outperform even Karambwans which only add a 2-tick (1.2 second) delay to attacking.

